  partName: Cylinder Head
  description: The Cylinder Head is a complex, medium-sized component situated at
    the top-center-front of the engine, responsible for directing air-fuel mixture
    into the cylinders and exhaust gases out of the engine. Constructed from Chrome.001,
    its intricate design and material properties enable it to withstand high temperatures
    and pressures. Interestingly, the Cylinder Head's design features optimized ports
    and chambers to enhance engine efficiency and power output.
